  "description": "Do-ae Ma carries a cruel curse. Anyone who loves her, or whom she loves, falls into misfortune. There's only one way to break this curse. She must find her true soulmate, the one who is immune to this curse. But there’s just one problem. Of all people, the only candidate who fits the bill is a good-for-nothing troublemaker named Seon-hwa Gong. Do-ae has no choice but to get involved with the worst possible man in order to end her curse. But will she be able to find her true love this time?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=849913), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14052414)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.webtoons.com/en/romance/how-to-love-a-cursed-girl/list?title_no=11120)",
